# Healthy control. C ⊑ ∃u.A, A ⊑ F, ∃u.F ⊑ D entails C ⊑ D by plain FLAT
# (non-nested) monotonicity — the sibling of nested-mono.ofn's #80 defect
# with the ∃t.∃u wrapper removed. rustdl's saturator handles the flat case
# correctly; only nesting trips it. Basic EL entailment, uncontested.
provenance: structural   # basic EL entailment, uncontested; rustdl gets this right
subclass: C D
